{"page":"NDST1","gene":"NDST1","accession":"P52848","protein":"Bifunctional heparan sulfate N-deacetylase/N-sulfotransferase 1","length":882,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"P52848-1","name":"1","synonyms":["NDST1A"],"notes":[{"topic":"Function","text":"Essential bifunctional enzyme that catalyzes both the N-deacetylation and the N-sulfation of glucosamine (GlcNAc) of the glycosaminoglycan in heparan sulfate (PubMed:35137078, PubMed:9230113, PubMed:9744796). Modifies the GlcNAc-GlcA disaccharide repeating sugar backbone to make N-sulfated heparosan, a prerequisite substrate for later modifications in heparin biosynthesis (PubMed:9230113). Plays a role in determining the extent and pattern of sulfation of heparan sulfate. Participates in biosynthesis of heparan sulfate that can ultimately serve as L-selectin ligands, thereby playing a role in inflammatory response (By similarity). Required for the exosomal release of SDCBP, CD63 and syndecan (PubMed:22660413)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with heparan sulfate co-polymerase subunits EXT1 and EXT2. Interacts with NDST1 isoform 3"}],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000261797.7","ENST00000891667.1","ENST00000891668.1","ENST00000891669.1","ENST00000891674.1","ENST00000891675.1","ENST00000891676.1","ENST00000891677.1","ENST00000937575.1","ENST00000937577.1","ENST00000937578.1","ENST00000937579.1","ENST00000965561.1"],"refseq":["NM_001543.5"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001534.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-P52848-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P52848-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":90,"plddt":[[0,10],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[70,20],[50,1],[70,1],[50,3],[0,38],[50,2],[70,1],[90,11],[70,1],[90,23],[70,2],[50,3],[70,2],[90,4],[70,3],[90,44],[70,1],[90,2],[70,2],[90,34],[70,2],[90,29],[70,2],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,10],[50,1],[70,1],[90,62],[70,1],[90,75],[70,2],[90,61],[70,2],[90,25],[70,2],[90,8],[70,1],[90,97],[70,1],[90,64],[70,4],[50,4],[70,1